{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Flyn API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "summary": "Short links, QR codes, custom domains, retargeting pixels, conversion tracking and webhooks.",
    "description": "The Flyn REST API creates and manages short links, QR codes, custom domains, retargeting pixels, conversion tracking and webhooks.\n\n**Base URL:** `https://www.flyn.to`. Every path starts with `/api`. Request and response bodies are JSON.\n\n**Authentication:** send `Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_<64 hex>`. Create keys in Settings > API Keys (`/settings?tab=api`); creating a key requires a Pro, Lifetime or Team plan, where Team means a member of a paying owner's workspace (effective plan `team`). Some endpoints also accept the signed-in dashboard session cookie, and six accept OAuth access tokens issued to AI assistants over MCP (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`, available on every plan). Each operation says which it accepts. The conversion ingest endpoints need no authentication.\n\n**Workspace:** a key acts in its own team, or else in the workspace the user last selected in the dashboard, as long as that membership is still active.\n\n**Plan rules:** paid features answer 403 with `code: UPGRADE_REQUIRED` and `upgradeUrl: /pricing` on the Free plan. A key keeps working if its account later moves to Free, and the Free limits described on each operation then apply. Team members inherit the plan of a paying, non-suspended workspace owner.\n\n**Rate limits:** every limit is counted per client IP address, not per key or account. Each endpoint has its own fixed window that starts at the first request and is held in memory on each server instance, except where operations share a bucket: POST and PATCH /api/pixels share one, the GET and POST ingest operations on /api/conversion and /api/postback share one, and POST /api/domains/add shares one with its alias POST /api/domains. Limits are checked before authentication unless an operation says otherwise. A 429 carries `Retry-After` (seconds) unless the operation says it does not.\n\n**Errors:** `{\"error\": \"<message>\"}`, sometimes with `code` (UPGRADE_REQUIRED, DESTINATION_BLOCKED, INVALID_TARGETING, ROTATION_ACTIVE, LIMIT_REACHED, DAILY_LIMIT, MONTHLY_LIMIT) and extra fields such as `upgradeUrl`, `limit`, `used`, `premiumFields`, `category` or `signupUrl`. The conversion ingest endpoints answer `{\"ok\": false, \"error\": \"<message>\"}` instead.\n\n**Webhooks:** Flyn signs every delivery with HMAC-SHA256; see the webhooks section for payloads and signature verification.\n\n**Short links:** examples show short URLs on flyn.co, the domain new links are created on by default.\n\nGuides and examples: https://www.flyn.to/docs",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Flyn",
      "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs"
    }
  },
  "externalDocs": {
    "description": "Flyn API documentation",
    "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://www.flyn.to"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Links",
      "description": "Create, list, read, update and delete short links one at a time, or create 2 to 50 links for one destination with bulk-create.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/links"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Quick Shorten",
      "description": "Minimal shortener that also works without an account.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/shorten"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "QR Codes",
      "description": "QR codes for your short links, and a stateless encoder for URLs, text, Wi-Fi, vCards, email, phone and SMS.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/qr-codes"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Click Analytics",
      "description": "Raw human click events per link.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/clicks"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Domains",
      "description": "Custom domains for branded short links.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/domains"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Retargeting Pixels",
      "description": "Saved ad-platform pixels that fire when a link is clicked.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/retargeting-pixels"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversion Tracking",
      "description": "Record conversions against a click id and read the conversion report.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/conversion-tracking"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhooks",
      "description": "Signed HTTP callbacks for link clicks and link changes.",
      "externalDocs": {
        "url": "https://www.flyn.to/docs/webhooks"
      }
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/links": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Links"
        ],
        "operationId": "listLinks",
        "summary": "List links",
        "description": "Lists links in the caller's workspace (the team, or the personal account), paginated, filterable and sortable. Each item is a full Link.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`) or an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`). The dashboard session cookie is not accepted.\n\n**Plan:** every plan. Any team role, including viewer.\n\n**Rate limit:** 30 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.\n\nUnrecognised `status` and `sort` values are ignored rather than rejected.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Page number, floored at 1.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "default": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Items per page, clamped to 1..100.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 100,
              "default": 50
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Filter by state. `active`: status active, not past its expiry date and not disabled by Flyn (a link that has used up its click limit still counts). `expired`: status set to expired or past its expiry date, and not archived. `archived`: archived. Any other value applies no filter.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "active",
                "expired",
                "archived"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "search",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Case-insensitive substring match on slug, destination and title. Double quotes and backslashes are stripped; cut to 100 characters.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 100
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "tag",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Only links carrying this exact tag.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "folder_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Only links in this folder.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sort",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Sort column; anything else falls back to created_at.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "created_at",
                "clicks",
                "slug",
                "title"
              ],
              "default": "created_at"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "order",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "`asc` sorts ascending; any other value sorts descending.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "asc",
                "desc"
              ],
              "default": "desc"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The page of links.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LinkList"
                },
                "example": {
                  "links": [
                    {
                      "id": "3f0c2a9e-7b1d-4c55-9a0e-2d8f1b6c4e11",
                      "slug": "summer-sale",
                      "url": "https://shop.example.com/sale",
                      "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/summer-sale",
                      "domain": "flyn.co",
                      "title": "shop.example.com",
                      "clicks": 0,
                      "botClicks": 0,
                      "qrScans": 0,
                      "totalClicks": 0,
                      "status": "active",
                      "tags": [],
                      "createdAt": "2026-09-23T10:00:00.123456+00:00",
                      "expiresAt": null,
                      "folderId": null,
                      "password": false,
                      "ogTitle": null,
                      "ogDescription": null,
                      "ogImage": null,
                      "targeting": null,
                      "cloaking": false,
                      "noIndex": false,
                      "notes": null,
                      "abUrlB": null,
                      "abSplit": null,
                      "rotation": null,
                      "deepLink": false,
                      "pixelIds": [],
                      "forwardParams": true,
                      "clickLimit": null,
                      "fallbackUrl": null,
                      "conversionTracking": false,
                      "conversions": 0,
                      "conversionValueCents": 0,
                      "conversionCurrency": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "pagination": {
                    "page": 1,
                    "limit": 50,
                    "total": 1,
                    "totalPages": 1,
                    "hasMore": false
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing header, wrong prefix, unknown or revoked key, expired key, or an invalid MCP OAuth token. Messages: \"Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_...\", \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Invalid or expired OAuth token\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_..."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "The account is suspended.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This account has been suspended."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 30 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Query error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to fetch links"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Links"
        ],
        "operationId": "createLink",
        "summary": "Create a link",
        "description": "Creates one short link with the full option set and returns it. Sends a link.create webhook to the calling user's webhooks.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`) or an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`). The dashboard session cookie is not accepted.\n\n**Plan:** Free accounts can create 25 links per UTC calendar month (counted per workspace), may not use a custom domain, and may not set the fields marked Pro; each returns 403 `UPGRADE_REQUIRED`. Pro, Lifetime or Team (a member of a paying owner's workspace has the effective plan `team`) have no limits here. The viewer team role gets 403.\n\n**Rate limit:** 10 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.\n\nAn invalid JSON body returns 500, not 400.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LinkCreateRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "url": "https://shop.example.com/sale",
                "slug": "summer-sale"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "The created link.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Link"
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": "3f0c2a9e-7b1d-4c55-9a0e-2d8f1b6c4e11",
                  "slug": "summer-sale",
                  "url": "https://shop.example.com/sale",
                  "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/summer-sale",
                  "domain": "flyn.co",
                  "title": "shop.example.com",
                  "clicks": 0,
                  "botClicks": 0,
                  "qrScans": 0,
                  "totalClicks": 0,
                  "status": "active",
                  "tags": [],
                  "createdAt": "2026-09-23T10:00:00.123456+00:00",
                  "expiresAt": null,
                  "folderId": null,
                  "password": false,
                  "ogTitle": null,
                  "ogDescription": null,
                  "ogImage": null,
                  "targeting": null,
                  "cloaking": false,
                  "noIndex": false,
                  "notes": null,
                  "abUrlB": null,
                  "abSplit": null,
                  "rotation": null,
                  "deepLink": false,
                  "pixelIds": [],
                  "forwardParams": true,
                  "clickLimit": null,
                  "fallbackUrl": null,
                  "conversionTracking": false,
                  "conversions": 0,
                  "conversionValueCents": 0,
                  "conversionCurrency": null
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Validation failed. Messages include \"Request body must be valid JSON\", \"Request body must be a JSON object\", \"deepLink must be true or false\", \"url is required\", \"Unsupported URL protocol\", \"Invalid URL\", \"Cannot shorten Flyn URLs\", \"Private/internal URLs are not allowed\", \"Slug can only contain letters, numbers, hyphens, and underscores\", \"Slug must be 100 characters or fewer\", \"This slug is reserved. Please choose a different one.\", \"A link can rotate between at most 12 destinations. You sent 15.\", \"Invalid expiration date\", \"Click limit must be a whole number between 1 and 2147483647\", and targeting errors with code `INVALID_TARGETING`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "url is required"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing header, wrong prefix, unknown or revoked key, expired key, or an invalid MCP OAuth token. Messages: \"Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_...\", \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Invalid or expired OAuth token\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_..."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Viewer role (\"You do not have permission to create links in this workspace. Contact your team admin.\"), Free monthly cap (code `UPGRADE_REQUIRED` with `limit` and `used`), Free custom domain or Pro field (code `UPGRADE_REQUIRED` with `premiumFields`), custom domain not owned (\"Domain not found or not owned by you\"), or a suspended account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "You've reached the Free plan's 25 links / month limit. Upgrade to Pro for unlimited links.",
                  "code": "UPGRADE_REQUIRED",
                  "upgradeUrl": "/pricing",
                  "limit": 25,
                  "used": 25
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "folderId is not in the workspace.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Folder not found"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "The slug is already taken on that domain.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This slug is already taken on this domain. Try a different slug or domain."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "The destination, a rotation URL, abUrlB, fallbackUrl or a targeting URL failed the safety scan.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This destination is not allowed under our Acceptable Use policy.",
                  "code": "DESTINATION_BLOCKED",
                  "category": "malware"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 10 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "A non-string password or a database error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to create link"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/links/{id}": {
      "parameters": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LinkId"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Links"
        ],
        "operationId": "getLink",
        "summary": "Get a link",
        "description": "Fetches one link in the caller's workspace.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`), an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`), or the signed-in dashboard session cookie when neither is sent.\n\n**Plan:** every plan. Any team role.\n\n**Rate limit:** 60 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The link.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Link"
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": "3f0c2a9e-7b1d-4c55-9a0e-2d8f1b6c4e11",
                  "slug": "summer-sale",
                  "url": "https://shop.example.com/sale",
                  "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/summer-sale",
                  "domain": "flyn.co",
                  "title": "shop.example.com",
                  "clicks": 0,
                  "botClicks": 0,
                  "qrScans": 0,
                  "totalClicks": 0,
                  "status": "active",
                  "tags": [],
                  "createdAt": "2026-09-23T10:00:00.123456+00:00",
                  "expiresAt": null,
                  "folderId": null,
                  "password": false,
                  "ogTitle": null,
                  "ogDescription": null,
                  "ogImage": null,
                  "targeting": null,
                  "cloaking": false,
                  "noIndex": false,
                  "notes": null,
                  "abUrlB": null,
                  "abSplit": null,
                  "rotation": null,
                  "deepLink": false,
                  "pixelIds": [],
                  "forwardParams": true,
                  "clickLimit": null,
                  "fallbackUrl": null,
                  "conversionTracking": false,
                  "conversions": 0,
                  "conversionValueCents": 0,
                  "conversionCurrency": null
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No valid API key and no dashboard session. Messages: \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header.\", or \"Unauthorized\" when the session lookup itself fails. An MCP OAuth token lands here too.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "The account is suspended.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This account has been suspended."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found in the workspace.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Link not found"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 60 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to fetch link"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "Links"
        ],
        "operationId": "updateLink",
        "summary": "Update a link",
        "description": "Partial update. Only recognised fields are written. Returns the updated Link and sends a link.update webhook to the calling user's webhooks.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`), an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`), or the signed-in dashboard session cookie when neither is sent.\n\n**Plan:** on Free, a custom domain or a Pro field set to a real value returns 403 `UPGRADE_REQUIRED`; there is no monthly cap on edits. Pro, Lifetime or Team (a member of a paying owner's workspace has the effective plan `team`) have no gate. **Team roles:** viewer gets 403; a member may edit only links they created; owner and admin may edit any link in the workspace.\n\n**Rate limit:** 10 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.\n\nAn invalid JSON body returns 500.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LinkUpdateRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "url": "https://shop.example.com/sale-v2",
                "title": "Summer sale"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The updated link.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Link"
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": "3f0c2a9e-7b1d-4c55-9a0e-2d8f1b6c4e11",
                  "slug": "summer-sale",
                  "url": "https://shop.example.com/sale-v2",
                  "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/summer-sale",
                  "domain": "flyn.co",
                  "title": "Summer sale",
                  "clicks": 42,
                  "botClicks": 3,
                  "qrScans": 5,
                  "totalClicks": 45,
                  "status": "active",
                  "tags": [
                    "q3"
                  ],
                  "createdAt": "2026-09-23T10:00:00.123456+00:00",
                  "expiresAt": null,
                  "folderId": null,
                  "password": false,
                  "ogTitle": null,
                  "ogDescription": null,
                  "ogImage": null,
                  "targeting": null,
                  "cloaking": false,
                  "noIndex": false,
                  "notes": null,
                  "abUrlB": null,
                  "abSplit": null,
                  "rotation": null,
                  "deepLink": false,
                  "pixelIds": [],
                  "forwardParams": true,
                  "clickLimit": null,
                  "fallbackUrl": null,
                  "conversionTracking": false,
                  "conversions": 0,
                  "conversionValueCents": 0,
                  "conversionCurrency": null
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Nothing recognised in the body, or a validation failure. Messages include \"Request body must be valid JSON\", \"Request body must be a JSON object\", \"No fields to update\", \"url must be a non-empty string\", \"Cannot shorten Flyn URLs\", \"slug must be a non-empty string\", \"deepLink must be true or false\", \"forwardParams must be true or false\", \"pixelIds must be an array of pixel ids; send [] to clear\", \"domain must be a non-empty string. To move a link back to the default short domain, send \\\"<the default short domain>\\\".\", \"Invalid status. Use: active, expired, archived\", \"This slug is reserved\", targeting errors with code `INVALID_TARGETING`, \"A link can rotate between at most 12 destinations. You sent 13.\", and the URL, date and click-limit messages of create.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "No fields to update"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No valid API key and no dashboard session. Messages: \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header.\", or \"Unauthorized\" when the session lookup itself fails. An MCP OAuth token lands here too.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Viewer role, a member editing another member's link (\"Only the person who created this link, or a workspace owner or admin, can edit it.\"), a Free custom domain or Pro field (code `UPGRADE_REQUIRED` with `premiumFields`), a domain the workspace does not own (\"Domain not found or not owned by you\"), or a suspended account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Link rotation is only available on Pro or Lifetime. Upgrade at /pricing.",
                  "code": "UPGRADE_REQUIRED",
                  "upgradeUrl": "/pricing",
                  "premiumFields": [
                    "rotation"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "The link or the folderId is not in the workspace (\"Link not found\" or \"Folder not found\").",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Link not found"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Slug clash (\"Slug already exists\"), including when the back-half already exists on the domain the link is moving to, or abUrlB/abSplit sent without `rotation` for a link whose stored rotation is anything other than the legacy two-destination A/B pair with ids A and B (code `ROTATION_ACTIVE`; the message says \"more than two destinations\" even when there are fewer).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This link uses rotation with more than two destinations. Update the `rotation` array instead of abUrlB/abSplit.",
                  "code": "ROTATION_ACTIVE"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "A URL that would be served failed the safety scan.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This destination is not allowed under our Acceptable Use policy.",
                  "code": "DESTINATION_BLOCKED",
                  "category": "malware"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 10 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "A database error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to update link"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Links"
        ],
        "operationId": "deleteLink",
        "summary": "Delete a link",
        "description": "Permanently deletes the link and its click history. Sends a link.delete webhook, carrying the link as it was, to the calling user's webhooks.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`), an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`), or the signed-in dashboard session cookie when neither is sent.\n\n**Plan:** every plan. **Team roles:** viewer gets 403; a member may delete only links they created; owner and admin may delete any.\n\n**Rate limit:** 60 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Deleted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LinkDeleted"
                },
                "example": {
                  "deleted": true,
                  "id": "3f0c2a9e-7b1d-4c55-9a0e-2d8f1b6c4e11"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No valid API key and no dashboard session. Messages: \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header.\", or \"Unauthorized\" when the session lookup itself fails. An MCP OAuth token lands here too.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Viewer role, a member deleting another member's link, or a suspended account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Only the person who created this link, or a workspace owner or admin, can delete it."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found in the workspace.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Link not found"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 60 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Database error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to delete link"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/links/bulk-create": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Links"
        ],
        "operationId": "bulkCreateLinks",
        "summary": "Create many links to one destination",
        "description": "Link multiplier: creates 2 to 50 short links to the same destination in one atomic insert, all carrying one batch tag. No link.create webhooks are sent for these links.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`), or the signed-in dashboard session cookie when no API key header is sent. MCP OAuth access tokens are not accepted here and get 401.\n\n**Plan:** Pro, Lifetime or Team (a member of a paying owner's workspace has the effective plan `team`) only; Free gets 403 `UPGRADE_REQUIRED` before the body is read. The viewer team role gets 403.\n\n**Rate limit:** 10 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BulkCreateRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "url": "https://yourblog.com/post-to-pin",
                "quantity": 2,
                "tag": "spring-pins"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "The batch was created.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BulkCreateResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "created": 2,
                  "tag": "spring-pins",
                  "url": "https://yourblog.com/post-to-pin",
                  "links": [
                    {
                      "slug": "aB9xZq",
                      "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/aB9xZq"
                    },
                    {
                      "slug": "Kp3wLm",
                      "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/Kp3wLm"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad JSON, missing url, quantity out of range, or URL validation. Messages: \"Invalid JSON\", \"url is required\", \"quantity must be a whole number between 2 and 50\", \"Unsupported URL protocol\", \"Invalid URL\", \"Cannot shorten Flyn URLs\", \"Private/internal URLs are not allowed\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "quantity must be a whole number between 2 and 50"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No valid API key and no dashboard session. Messages: \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header.\", or \"Unauthorized\" when the session lookup itself fails. An MCP OAuth token lands here too.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Free plan (code `UPGRADE_REQUIRED`), viewer role, custom domain not owned, or a suspended account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "The link multiplier requires a paid plan. Upgrade at /pricing, Pro from $9/mo or $249 lifetime.",
                  "code": "UPGRADE_REQUIRED",
                  "upgradeUrl": "/pricing"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "The destination failed the safety scan.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This destination is not allowed under our Acceptable Use policy.",
                  "code": "DESTINATION_BLOCKED",
                  "category": "malware"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 10 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests. Try again shortly."
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "The insert failed.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to create links. Please try again."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/shorten": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Quick Shorten"
        ],
        "operationId": "shortenUrl",
        "summary": "Quick shorten a URL",
        "description": "Minimal shortener that works with or without authentication. Returns a slim object, not a Link. No link.create webhook is sent.\n\n**Auth:** optional. With an `Authorization` header it must be a valid API key or MCP OAuth access token (an invalid one is a 401, never an anonymous fallback). With no header, a signed-in dashboard session cookie counts as authenticated. With neither, the request is anonymous: the link is created on Flyn's anonymous short domain and expires after 24 hours.\n\n**Bot check (anonymous and session callers):** requests without an Authorization header must send an `Accept` header and a `User-Agent` of at least 10 characters that does not look like a bot, crawler or HTTP library (curl, wget, python-requests, Postman and similar), else 403.\n\n**Plan:** no Pro-field gating here. The plan is the effective plan for an API key or OAuth token (a member of a paying owner's workspace has `team`), but the member's own plan for a session-cookie caller, whose links are always personal, never team links. On Free the cap is 25 links per UTC month, counted per user (429 `MONTHLY_LIMIT`); when a Free key or token acts in a team, the database also counts the team's links this month and fails the create with 500 once the team has 25. Pro, Lifetime and `team` are uncapped. Anonymous callers get 5 requests per IP per 24-hour fixed window that starts at their first request (in memory per server instance). Every anonymous request that passes the bot check and the per-minute limit counts, including ones that then fail validation (429 `DAILY_LIMIT`).\n\n**Rate limit:** 5 requests per 60 s per IP anonymous, 30 authenticated, in one shared bucket per IP (fixed window, in memory per server instance). Each per-minute 429 also blocks the IP for 60 s; requests during the block get 429 with `Retry-After` set to the seconds left. (Only overlapping requests that carry a dashboard session cookie can stretch a block to 300 s or more.) X-RateLimit-* headers are sent only on the 200 and on the per-minute 429.",
        "security": [
          {},
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "User-Agent",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Checked by the bot filter when no Authorization header is sent.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ShortenRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "url": "https://example.com/a/very/long/page",
                "slug": "launch-day"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Created. Anonymous responses also set cookies that let the visitor claim the link after signing up.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ShortenResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": "a1b2c3d4-5e6f-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
                  "slug": "launch-day",
                  "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/launch-day",
                  "expiresAt": null,
                  "authenticated": true
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "X-RateLimit-Limit": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRateLimitLimit"
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Remaining": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRateLimitRemaining"
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Reset": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRateLimitReset"
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Validation failed. Messages: \"URL is required\", \"URL is too long (max 2048 characters)\", \"Unsupported URL protocol\", \"Invalid URL\", \"Cannot shorten Flyn URLs\", \"Slug can only contain letters, numbers, hyphens, and underscores\", \"Slug must be 100 characters or fewer\", \"This slug is reserved\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "URL is required"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "An Authorization header was sent but is not a valid key or token.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Invalid or revoked API key"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Bot fingerprint without an Authorization header (\"Request blocked. Please use a browser.\"), custom domain not owned, or a suspended account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Request blocked. Please use a browser."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "The slug is already taken on that domain.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This slug is already taken on this domain. Try a different slug."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Category blocklist or safety scan.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This destination is not allowed under our Acceptable Use policy.",
                  "code": "DESTINATION_BLOCKED",
                  "category": "malware"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Penalty cooldown (\"You've been temporarily blocked due to excessive requests. Please try again later.\", with Retry-After), per-minute limit (\"Too many requests. Please slow down and try again.\", with Retry-After and X-RateLimit-*), anonymous daily cap (code `DAILY_LIMIT`, no Retry-After), or the Free monthly cap (code `MONTHLY_LIMIT`, no Retry-After).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "You've reached your free plan limit of 25 links this month. Upgrade to Pro for unlimited links!",
                  "code": "MONTHLY_LIMIT",
                  "upgradeUrl": "/settings/billing"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Limit": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRateLimitLimit"
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Remaining": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRateLimitRemaining"
              },
              "X-RateLimit-Reset": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRateLimitReset"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Invalid JSON body (\"Server error\") or a database error (\"Failed to create link\"), which includes the database's Free monthly cap on a team's links.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Server error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/links/{id}/qr": {
      "parameters": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LinkId"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "QR Codes"
        ],
        "operationId": "getLinkQrCode",
        "summary": "Get a QR code for a link",
        "description": "Renders a QR image for a link in the caller's workspace. The image encodes the short URL with `?flyn_qr=1` appended so scans are counted in `qrScans`; the response reports the clean shortUrl.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`) or an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`). The dashboard session cookie is not accepted.\n\n**Plan:** PNG in the default colours on every plan. `format=svg` or any colour other than fg #14532D on bg #FFFFFF needs Pro, Lifetime or Team (a member of a paying owner's workspace has the effective plan `team`); Free gets 403 `UPGRADE_REQUIRED`. Any team role.\n\n**Rate limit:** 60 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.\n\nIn a query string the `#` of a colour must be sent as `%23`.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "format",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Image format, case-sensitive. svg is Pro.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "png",
                "svg"
              ],
              "default": "png"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "size",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Target width in px, clamped to 64..2048 and rounded. The output snaps down to whole modules. Non-numeric is 400.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 64,
              "maximum": 2048,
              "default": 512
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "margin",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Quiet zone in modules, clamped to 4..32.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 4,
              "maximum": 32,
              "default": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "level",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Error correction, upper-cased first.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "L",
                "M",
                "Q",
                "H"
              ],
              "default": "M"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "fg",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Foreground colour (send `#` as `%23`). Non-default is Pro; equal to bg is 400.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$",
              "default": "#14532D"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "bg",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Background colour (send `#` as `%23`). Non-default is Pro.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$",
              "default": "#FFFFFF"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The rendered QR code.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LinkQrResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "shortUrl": "https://flyn.co/spring-promo",
                  "qrDataUrl": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAA...",
                  "qr": {
                    "size": 481,
                    "margin": 4,
                    "level": "M",
                    "fg": "#14532D",
                    "bg": "#FFFFFF",
                    "format": "png",
                    "moduleSize": 13,
                    "symbolModules": 29
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "A malformed option or too much data. Messages include \"format must be 'png' or 'svg'.\", \"level must be one of 'L', 'M', 'Q', 'H'.\", \"size must be a number.\", \"margin must be a number.\", \"fg must be a 6-digit hex colour such as #14532D.\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "format must be 'png' or 'svg'."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing header, wrong prefix, unknown or revoked key, expired key, or an invalid MCP OAuth token. Messages: \"Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_...\", \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Invalid or expired OAuth token\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_..."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "SVG or custom colours on Free (code `UPGRADE_REQUIRED`), or a suspended account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "SVG export is a Flyn Pro feature. PNG is available on every plan.",
                  "code": "UPGRADE_REQUIRED",
                  "upgradeUrl": "/pricing"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found in the workspace.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Link not found"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 60 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected render error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to generate QR code"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/qr": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "QR Codes"
        ],
        "operationId": "createQrCode",
        "summary": "Encode content as a QR code",
        "description": "Stateless QR encoder for seven content types: url, text, wifi, vcard, email, phone and sms. Nothing is stored or tracked.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`) or an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`). The dashboard session cookie is not accepted.\n\n**Plan:** url, text and wifi with PNG and the default colours on every plan. vcard, email, phone, sms, SVG and custom colours need Pro, Lifetime or Team (a member of a paying owner's workspace has the effective plan `team`); Free gets 403 `UPGRADE_REQUIRED`.\n\n**Rate limit:** 60 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QrRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "type": "wifi",
                "wifiSsid": "Cafe Guest",
                "wifiPass": "flatwhite2026",
                "wifiEnc": "WPA"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The rendered QR code.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QrResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "type": "wifi",
                  "label": "WiFi: Cafe Guest",
                  "payload": "WIFI:T:WPA;S:Cafe Guest;P:flatwhite2026;;",
                  "qrDataUrl": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAA...",
                  "qr": {
                    "size": 481,
                    "margin": 4,
                    "level": "M",
                    "fg": "#14532D",
                    "bg": "#FFFFFF",
                    "format": "png",
                    "moduleSize": 13,
                    "symbolModules": 29
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Body, type, field or option errors. Messages include \"Body must be valid JSON.\", \"type must be one of: url, text, wifi, vcard, email, phone, sms.\", \"wifiEnc must be one of: WPA, WEP, nopass. WPA3 networks use WPA.\", \"A wifi QR code needs \\\"wifiSsid\\\".\", render option errors, and \"That is too much data for a QR code (...)\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "A wifi QR code needs \"wifiSsid\"."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing header, wrong prefix, unknown or revoked key, expired key, or an invalid MCP OAuth token. Messages: \"Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_...\", \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Invalid or expired OAuth token\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_..."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "A Pro content type, SVG or custom colours on Free (code `UPGRADE_REQUIRED`), or a suspended account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "V-card QR codes are a Flyn Pro feature. Link, Text and WiFi QR codes are available on every plan.",
                  "code": "UPGRADE_REQUIRED",
                  "upgradeUrl": "/pricing"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 60 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected render error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to generate QR code"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/links/{id}/clicks": {
      "parameters": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LinkId"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Click Analytics"
        ],
        "operationId": "listLinkClicks",
        "summary": "List clicks for a link",
        "description": "Raw click events for one link in the caller's workspace, newest first. Bots are filtered out on the redirect, so these are human clicks, except that clicks recorded when a password-protected link is unlocked are not bot-filtered.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`) or an MCP OAuth access token (`Bearer flyn_mcp_at_...`). The dashboard session cookie is not accepted.\n\n**Plan:** every plan may call it. On Free only the last 30 days are returned (a rolling read window) and country, city, device, os, browser and referrer are null. Pro, Lifetime or Team (a member of a paying owner's workspace has the effective plan `team`) get full detail and unlimited history. Any team role.\n\n**Rate limit:** 30 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Page number, at least 1.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "default": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Page size, clamped to 1..1000.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 1000,
              "default": 100
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The page of clicks.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ClickList"
                },
                "example": {
                  "clicks": [
                    {
                      "id": "5c6d7e8f-9a0b-4c1d-8e2f-3a4b5c6d7e8f",
                      "timestamp": "2026-09-20T14:22:05.000Z",
                      "country": "US",
                      "city": "San Francisco",
                      "device": "desktop",
                      "os": "macOS",
                      "browser": "Chrome",
                      "referrer": "Direct"
                    }
                  ],
                  "pagination": {
                    "page": 1,
                    "limit": 100,
                    "total": 1,
                    "totalPages": 1,
                    "hasMore": false
                  },
                  "planLimits": {
                    "advancedAnalytics": true,
                    "retentionDays": null
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing header, wrong prefix, unknown or revoked key, expired key, or an invalid MCP OAuth token. Messages: \"Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_...\", \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Invalid or expired OAuth token\".",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Missing or invalid API key. Use: Authorization: Bearer flyn_sk_live_..."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "The account is suspended.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "This account has been suspended."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found in the workspace.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Link not found"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "More than 30 requests in the window. Counted per client IP. Retry-After gives the seconds until the window resets.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Too many requests"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Query error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Failed to fetch clicks"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/domains": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Domains"
        ],
        "operationId": "listDomains",
        "summary": "List custom domains",
        "description": "Lists custom domains, newest first. In a team workspace only the team's domains are listed (personal ones are not); otherwise the caller's own.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`), or the signed-in dashboard session cookie when no API key header is sent. MCP OAuth access tokens are not accepted here and get 401.\n\n**Plan:** every plan. Any team role.\n\n**Rate limit:** 30 requests per 60 s per client IP, fixed window, in memory per server instance, checked before authentication.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The domains.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DomainList"
                },
                "example": {
                  "domains": [
                    {
                      "id": "6d1f0b2a-9c3e-4f5a-8b7c-1e2d3f4a5b6c",
                      "user_id": "0a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a6b-8c7d-9e0f1a2b3c4d",
                      "team_id": null,
                      "domain": "go.brand.com",
                      "slug": "go-brand-com",
                      "verified": true,
                      "status": "active",
                      "txt_record": "flyn-verify=9f2c4e6a8b0d1f3e5a7c9e1b3d5f7a9c",
                      "cname_target": "cname.flyn.to",
                      "last_checked_at": "2026-09-23T10:20:00.123456+00:00",
                      "verified_at": "2026-09-23T10:20:00.123456+00:00",
                      "placeholder": "Enter your destination URL",
                      "not_found_url": null,
                      "created_at": "2026-09-23T10:00:00.123456+00:00",
                      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T10:20:00.123456+00:00",
                      "pause_warned_at": null,
                      "pause_scheduled_at": null,
                      "paused_at": null
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No valid API key and no dashboard session. Messages: \"Invalid or revoked API key\", \"API key has expired\", \"Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header.\", or \"Unauthorized\" when the session lookup itself fails. An MCP OAuth token lands here too.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Unauthorized. Sign in to the dashboard, or pass a Bearer API key in the Authorization header."
                }
