          "Retargeting Pixels"
        ],
        "operationId": "deletePixel",
        "summary": "Delete a retargeting pixel",
        "description": "Deletes a pixel the caller created. A teammate's pixel returns 404.\n\n**Auth:** API key (`Bearer flyn_sk_live_...`), or the signed-in dashboard session cookie when no API key header is sent. MCP OAuth access tokens are not accepted here and get 401.\n\n**Plan:** every plan. Only the creator can delete.\n\n**Rate limit:** none.\n\nA malformed (non-UUID) id returns 500.",
